Sen-Ben Liao, Peter Dourmashkin and John Belcher, with the MIT teaching team. MIT 8.02T, Spring 2005. [Course](https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/8-02t-electricity-and-magnetism-spring-2005/) · [Complete chapter notes](https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/8-02t-electricity-and-magnetism-spring-2005/pages/lecture-notes/) · [MIT TEAL chapter index](https://web.mit.edu/8.02t/www/802TEAL3D/visualizations/coursenotes/index.htm).

Use the full electricity/magnetism notes, problem sets, available examinations and experimental explanations. The notes carry a 2004 copyright date; the OCW course is Spring 2005. Visualizations support rather than replace calculations and observations.

OCW publishes under CC BY-NC-SA with identified exceptions; the older MIT site and individual third-party components retain their own notices. This is not a claim that every linked file has identical reuse rights. Course identity and public resource structure were checked on 29 October 2026. No visualization or media has been installed or tested here.

